      "title": "Qt: Warn for non-executable \"dumpcap\" on Unix.",
      "message": "Qt: Warn for non-executable \"dumpcap\" on Unix.\n\nThis usually means that the user needs to be granted privilege to run\n\"dumpcap\", e.g. by being added to that binary's group ID.  For now, we\njust raise that condition in the user-interface as a generic \"You\ndon't have permission to capture on local interfaces\" message.  It\nwould be nice to give more detail and/or suggested steps to resolve it\nand/or a link to a wiki page.\n\nPing #20257\n",
